  "body": "Some homes make an impression before you even reach the front door.\r\nAt 22A John Rymer Place, a striking blend of vertical cedar paired with sleek aluminium cladding gives the home a distinctive presence on the street. Step inside and you'll find the same thoughtful balance: contemporary style, generous proportions and the comfort of a home made for family life.\r\nDouble glazing, luxury bathrooms and ducted air conditioning make this a home that's ready to enjoy from day one. Across approximately 219 sqm, there's room for everyone to come together, and space to retreat when the day calls for it. At the heart of the home, the kitchen connects naturally with the living areas, whether it's a busy weekday morning or a long lunch with friends. Four double bedrooms include a private master suite with walk-in wardrobe and ensuite.\r\nOpen the living area onto the deck and the home takes on another rhythm. Summer dinners stretch into the evening; weekends drift between indoors and out. Established, low-maintenance grounds make it easy to enjoy the setting without giving up your spare time.\r\nA dedicated storage room, separate laundry and double internal-access garage bring everyday practicality to the picture. It's a home that feels considered in the details and generous in the ways that matter, with a lifestyle to match.\r\nSet in a quiet, established pocket of Kohimarama, this address puts the Eastern Bays within easy reach. St Thomas's School and Selwyn College are both within walking distance, and Kohimarama Beach, Madills Farm and nearby parks invite you outdoors. St Heliers Village is close by for coffee or dinner, Eastridge for everyday shopping, and Tamaki Drive offers an easy route into the CBD.\r\n\r\n* Distinctive exterior clad in a blend of vertical cedar paired with sleek aluminium \r\n* Approximately 219 sqm of generous family living\r\n* Four double bedrooms, including a master suite with walk-in wardrobe and ensuite\r\n* Luxury bathrooms\r\n* Double-glazed with ducted air conditioning for year-round comfort\r\n* Living area opening onto the deck for easy indoor-outdoor living\r\n* Dedicated storage room and separate laundry\r\n* Double internal-access garaging\r\n* Established, low-maintenance grounds\r\n* In zone for St Thomas's School and Selwyn College\r\n* Close to Kohimarama Beach and St Heliers Village\r\n\r\nDistinctive in appearance. Exceptional in lifestyle.",
